    "notification_text": "भा. कृ . अनु. प. – के न्द्रीय मात्स्यिकी शिक्षा संस्थान ICAR - CENTRAL INSTITUTE OF FISHERIES EDUCATION (Deemed University) (University under Sec. 3 of UGC Act), Indian Council of Agricultural Research Panch Marg, Off. Yari Road, Versova, Andheri (west), Mumbai 400 061 Tel. No. 022-26361446/7/8 Web Site : https://www.cife.edu.in GST No.27AAAAI1830P9ZB NOTICE Applications are invited from eligible candidates to engage PART TIME PHYSICIAN DOCTOR on monthly remuneration basis for providing medical services to Staff/Family/Student and Retired persons consisting 600 Nos. Remuneration: Rs. 40,000/- (Rupees Forty Thousand only) for 2 hours, three times a week. The eligible candidates may apply along with bio-data, certificates and testimonials at the above address on or before 19th June, 2026. The notification regarding the advertisement is available on our website https://www.cife.edu.in. Date: 04.06.2026 Sr. Administrative Officer Page 1 of 6 भा .कृ .अनु .प – .के न्द्रीय मात्स्यिकी शिक्षा संस्थान ICAR - CENTRAL INSTITUTE OF FISHERIES EDUCATION (मानित निश्वनिद्यालय[ )यूजीसी अनिनियम की िारा 3 के अंतर्गत निश्वनिद्यालय] भारतीय कृ नि अिुसंिाि पररिद पंच मार्ग, ऑफ यारी रोड, िसोिा, अंिेरी( पनिम), मुंबई – 400061 दूरभाि क्र .022-26361446/7/8 िेबसाइट : https://www.cife.edu.in GST No. 27AAAAI1830P9ZB सूचना संस्थाि में कायगरत कमगचाररयो/ं पररिारजिो/ं निद्यानथगयो ं एिं सेिानििृत्त व्यक्तियो ं )लर्भर् 600 संख्या( को नचनकत्सा सेिाएँ प्रदाि करिे हेतु मानसक मािदेय आिार पर अंिकाशिक शचशकत्सक (शिशिशियन डॉक्टर) नियुि करिे के नलए पात्र अभ्यनथगयो ं से आिेदि आमंनत्रत नकए जाते हैं। मानदेय : रु. 40,000/- (के िल चालीस हजार रुपये( प्रनत माह, 2 घंटे हेतु, सप्ताह में तीि नदि। इच्छुक एिं पात्र अभ्यथी अपिा आिेदि पत्र, बायोडाटा, प्रमाण पत्र एिं प्रशंसापत्र सनहत उपरोि पते पर नदिांक 19 िून, 2026 तक भेज सकते हैं। निज्ञापि से संबंनित निस्तृत सूचिा संस्थाि की िेबसाइट https://www.cife.edu.in पर उपलब्ध है। नदिांक : 04.06.2026 वररष्ठ प्रिासशनक अशिकारी Page 2 of 6 भा. कृ . अनु. प. – के न्द्रीय मात्स्यिकी शिक्षा संस्थान ICAR - CENTRAL INSTITUTE OF FISHERIES EDUCATION (Deemed University) (University under Sec. 3 of UGC Act), Indian Council of Agricultural Research Panch Marg, Off. Yari Road, Versova, Andheri (west), Mumbai 400 061 Tel. No. 022-26361446/7/8 Web Site : https://www.cife.edu.in GST No.27AAAAI1830P9ZB F.No.30-13/Cash/Medical Date:04/06/2026 NOTIFICATION Applications are invited from eligible candidates for a contractual position of Part-Time Medical Officer, purely on temporary basis, at ICAR- CENTRAL INSTITUTE OF FISHERIES EDUCATION, Versova, Mumbai- 400061.The eligibility criteria and terms & conditions prescribed for the purpose are as under: - Sr. Name of the Name of No. of Essential Desirable Qualifications No. Division the Post post(s) Qualifications 1 ICAR-CIFE Part Time 01 MBBS Degree duly Five (05) years of relevant Medical registered with experience in Hospitals/ Officer Medical Council of Nursing Homes preferably (PTMO) India/ Medical Council in Government of any State in India Establishments. 2. Terms & Conditions: Job 1. Providing medical assistance / advice / consultancy / treatment at Description the ICAR-CIFE for all the patients comprising i. ICAR-CIFE employees and their dependent family members; ii. ICAR Pensioners (including their dependent family members) registered with ICAR-CIFE; iii. Students of Academic Programmes iv. Participants of all training programmes; v. Contractual / Outsourced staff hired by the Academy; and vi. any other personnel as may be decided by ICAR-CIFE. 2. Any other relevant jobs assigned by Officer In-charge of the ICAR- CIFE or any other Competent Authority of the Academy. Page 3 of 6 Remuneration & • A fixed amount of Rs.40,000/- (Rupees Forty thousand only) per month as per the Working hours guidelines issued by ICAR from time to time. • The PTMO will be required to attend the Institute for minimum 02 hours per day. • The PTMO shall visit the ICAR-CIFE, a minimum of three (3) days a week and for less than three visits, the admissible remuneration shall be reduced proportionately. Duration of hiring For a period of 12 (Twelve) months and extendable for another period of two (02) years on yearly basis subject to performance of the individual Doctor and on mutual consent. Upper Age Limit Maximum age limit for engagement is 65 years. However, no engagement shall be permissible beyond 70 years. Mode of hiring Purely temporary and on contractual basis. 3. Other Terms & Conditions: I.The desirous and eligible candidates may send their applications (in the attached Proforma only) by mail only at ddocife@cife.edu.in and www.cife.edu.in. II. The applications fin the prescribed Proforma with duly self-attested photocopies of certificates of educational qualifications, experience etc. ddocife@cife.edu.in and https://www.cife.edu.in on or before 19th June, 2026. Late receipt of the applications will not be entertained under any circumstances. III. Interview of the eligible candidates will be intimated at a later date. IV. ICAR-CIFE, Mumbai, will not be held responsible to give any regular appointment after expiry of the stipulated period of engagement. Page 4 of 6 भा. कृ . अनु. प. – के न्द्रीय मात्स्यिकी शिक्षा संस्थान . ICAR - CENTRAL INSTITUTE OF FISHERIES EDUCATION Panch Marg, Off. Yari Road, Versova, Andheri (west), Mumbai 400 061 Tel. No. 022-26361446/7/8 Web Site : https://www.cife.edu.in GST No.27AAAAI1830P9ZB Application for the post of: PART-TIME MEDICAL OFFICER 1. Full Name in Block Letters Latest Passport size photograph 2. Father/ Husband Name 3. Sex Male/ Female/ Transgender 4. Date of Birth and Age as D.O.B.: Age: years on the closing date for receipt of applications. 5. Category (SC/ST/OBC/ PWD / Ex-Servicemen) 6. Address for Communication with PIN Code Contact No. Mobile No: E-mail 7. Educational Qualifications (from Highest degree onwards). Attach self-attested photocopies (no need of enclosing mark sheets) of all the certificates - Submission of Original documents is mandatory for verification at the time of reporting for duty. Qualifications Board / Univ. Division %of Mark s (a) (b) (c) 8. Experience, any (Attach Name of the Organization Designation Duration self-attested photocopies - Submission of Original documents is mandate for verification at the time of reporting for duty.) 9. Other Information, if any *Note: The acceptance, of reporting for duty by the selected candidate, at the Academy is subject to verification / production of required documents along with Original Certificates of qualification and experience, etc. claimed in the application. UNDERTAKING I do hereby declare and certify that the information furnished in the application are correct and true to the best of my knowledge and belief. I understand and agree that in the event of any Page 5 of 6 information being found false or incorrect / incomplete or ineligibility being detected at any time before or after the test/ selection, my candidature is liable to be rejected/ cancelled without notice. I shall be bound by the decision of Director, ICAR-CIFE, Versova. Place: Signature of the Candidate Date: Name: Page 6 of 6",
