    "notification_text": "1 ICAR - CENTRAL INSTITUTE OF FISHERIES EDUCATION (Deemed University), Indian Council of Agricultural Research Panch Marg, Off Yari Road, Versova, Andheri (West), Mumbai-400061 Tel. No. 022-26361446/7/8, Fax No. 022-26361573 Web Site : www.cife.edu.in INTERVIEW (Hybrid Mode) A hybrid mode interview is scheduled on 06.07.2026 from 11.00 AM onwards at ICAR-Central Institute of Fisheries Education, Mumbai, Yari Road Campus, for the selection of Young Professional-I (YP-I) on a contractual basis under the Maharashtra Gene Bank Project: ‘Inventorization, Biodiversity Characterization and Conservation of Marine Inter-Tidal Molluscs of Coastal Maharashtra’. The details are as follows: Name of the position No. of post Monthl y emolume nt Age Qualification Young Professional -I (YP-I) 01 Rs. 30000/- Fixed Minimum of 21 years and maximum of 45 years, with relaxation as per rules Essential: Master’s degree in Fisheries Science with specialization in Fish Biotechnology / Fisheries Resources Management / M.Sc in Life /Plant Sciences with specialization in Biotechnology. Desirable: Technical knowledge on DNA Barcoding/Molecular Markers, molluscan taxonomy Essential Requirement 1. First Division or 60% marks or equivalent overall grade point average in Master's degree. 2. Application with a Final Degree Certificate or a Provisional Degree Certificate will only be considered. Terms & Conditions 1. The above position is purely temporary (three years from the date of appointment) 2. ICAR guidelines will govern the tenure and service conditions for YP. 3. Only the candidates who fulfil all the eligibility conditions will be invited to appear for the online interview. 4. Place of work will be at ICAR-CIFE, Mumbai. 5. All invited candidates are requested to be present 10 minutes before the scheduled time on the date of the online interview and wait before being admitted to the session by the admin. 2 6. The selection will be based on academic performance, research experience and performance during the online interview. 7. Wherever age-related relaxations are claimed on account of category & previous employment or any other as applicable under GOI norms, the certificates are to be sent along with documents. 8. The decision of the Director, ICAR-CIFE, Mumbai, will be final and binding in all aspects. General instructions Last date of submission of application: Interested candidates may submit their application to: mbrahmane@cife.edu.in on or before 02 July 2026. 3 ICAR - CENTRAL INSTITUTE OF FISHERIES EDUCATION (Deemed University), Indian Council of Agricultural Research Panch Marg, Off Yari Road, Versova, Andheri (West), Mumbai-400061 Tel. No. 022-26361446/7/8, Fax No. 022-26361573 www.cife.edu.in Application for the position of Young Professional-I (YP-I) 1. Name of the Candidate (Block letters: 2. Father's/Husband's Name: 3. Correspondence Address with Pin Code: 4. Ph. No.& Email ID: 9597210473 - 5. Permanent Address with Pin Code: 6. Whether Belongs to SC/ST/OBC/General: 7. Date of Birth: .…)... Age as on……..…….days .....months……………years 8. Details of Educational/Professional/Technical Qualification: Degree Subje ct School/Department Board/University Month & Year of Passing Marks (obtained/ maximum) Division OGPA/C GPA High School (10th) Secondary High School (12th) Graduation Post- Graduation NET/GATE etc*. Other degree/diploma, if Any Any other specialized training 4 9 Are You Net Qualified Yes/No 10 Publications, if any (Number only-Provide the copy): 11 Present Employment details, if employed 12 Additional Information, if any 13. Work experience, if any Work Duration Organization/ Institute DECLARATION I hereby declare that the information furnished above is true, correct and complete to the best of my knowledge and belief. I shall not engage in any other job/work other than this project work during project work duration without written permission from the Project PI. Signature of the candidate:",
