    "notification_text": "ffi \\ ARUNACHAL PRADESH PUBLIC SERVICE COMMISSION ITANAGAR ^o. orb,*,oy, ,,ro111191o65 ! \\o6z Dated Itanagar, the 23'd July 2024 I . The candidates as mentioned in the rejected list can submit their grievances or other relevant detail along with the supporting documents on the APPSC website (Submission Form) by 1100 hrs on 26.07 .2024 (Friday) which shall be examined for consideration. 2. No further submission will be entertained with respect to the eligibility of candidates after 1100 hrs on 26.07 .2024 (Friday). 3. The final list of eligible candidates for the Viva Voce/ Interview will be published on the website on 26.07 .2024(Fnday) at 1 700 hrs. 4. The date of InterviewAy'iva Voce for the post of Dentsl Specialist has been fixed on 2od and/or 3d August,2024. The details regarding the time and venue will be informed with the Call Letters/Admit Cards. The Call Letters/Admit Cards of the eligible candidates shall be available for downloading from the APPSC website on 26.07.2024 (Friday) at 1800 hrs. 5. Only those applicants who have completed 3 years of experience in the concerned speciality after obtaining post-graduate degree or 5 years experience after obtaining post graduate diploma on or before 2od August, 2024 and have submitted all the requisite documents in accordance to the conditions specified in the Advertisement No.PSC-R(A)ll5/2022@) dated TthJune, 2024 for the post of Dental Specialist shall be eligible for appearing in the interview. 6. The decision of the Commission with respect to the eligibility of the candidates for the Viva Voce/ Interview shall be final. Yo (P a Mittal), IRS , APPSC Se Memo No. No. PSC-R(A)/I5/2022(ft) Copy to: Dated I ; the 23d July 2024 The Secretary to the Hon'ble Govemor, Arunachal Pradesh. The Commissioner to the Hon'ble Chief Minister, Arunachal Pradesh. The PS to the Hon'ble Chairman, APPSC. The Under Secretary to the Chief Secretary, GoAP. The Commissioner (Health and Family Welfare), CoAP. O